SUMMARY:Princeton Tango Club Weekly Classes
LOCATION:Friend Center\, 113 Convocation Room
DESCRIPTION:Come Join Us for Argentine Tango! Argentine Tango is an elega
 nt\, improvisational social dance built on connection\, musicality\, and
  presence. Join us for a cozy Monday evening of dancing\, taught by some
  of the best instructors in the country. No partner or experience necess
 ary\, just bring your curiosity and get ready to meet our wonderful tang
 o community! Our first class covers basic stepping and technique. The se
 cond class builds on these fundamentals to create beautiful improvisatio
 n.\nAudience: Faculty & Academic Professionals\, Staff\, Students\, Alum
 ni\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/princeton-tango-club-weekly-cl
 asses-2
URL:https://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/princeton-tango-club-weekly-cla
 sses-2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
