 ’Avignon 2026 with Aurélie Charon\, Emma Prat & Oksana Leuta
LOCATION:East Pyne Building 010
DESCRIPTION:Seuls en Scène 2026 presents a conversation with Aurélie Ch
 aron\, Emma Prat\, and Oksana Leuta\, who participated in L’Aube des q
 uestions at this year’s Festival d’Avignon to kick-off the celebrati
 on of the 80th anniversary of the legendary Festival. With director of F
 estival d’Avignon Tiago Rodrigues and scholar Patrick Boucheron\, Char
 on co-designed L’Aube des questions to mark the 80th edition of the Fe
 stival and formulate 80 questions for the future. Charon invited her art
 istic collaborators Emma Prat and Oksana Leuta\, among others\, to take 
 part in the special celebration held during the early hours of July 26\,
  2026\, following the closure of the Festival. During the conversation\,
  Léo Cohen-Paperman will also share his insights on this year’s Festi
 val and its continued magic as it celebrates this milestone anniversary 
 in 2027. Cohen-Paperman presented four productions at the fringe festiv\
 nAudience: Open to the Public\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/seu
 ls-en-scene-2026-presents-laube-des-questions-festival-davignon-2026-aur
