SUMMARY:Hands-On Data Analysis with Stata: From Cleaning to Regression
LOCATION:Firestone Library - A-6-F (Classroom)\, Firestone Library
DESCRIPTION:This workshop provides a comprehensive introduction to Stata 
 for students with no prior programming experience. Participants will lea
 rn essential skills for real-world data analysis\, including cleaning me
 ssy datasets\, creating meaningful visualizations\, and running their fi
 rst statistical analyses. The session covers data preparation techniques
  such as merging\, appending\, and recoding\, constructing new variables
 \, generating descriptive statistics\, creating professional graphs\, an
 d performing linear regression analysis. No prior knowledge of Stata or 
 data analysis is required\, and all instructions will use real-world dat
 asets with step-by-step guidance.\nAudience: Faculty & Academic Professi
 onals\, Staff\, Students\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/hands-da
 ta-analysis-stata-cleaning-regression
