SUMMARY:Getting Started with Sysrev:: A Platform for Systematic Literatur
 e Reviews
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a hands-on introduction to Sysrev\, Princeton Uni
 versity’s newly licensed campus platform for systematic literature rev
 iews and data extraction. In this session\, Product Lead TJ Bozada will 
 walk through setting up your first project\, automating document screeni
 ng with built-in machine learning models and the Sysrev Auto-labeler\, d
 esigning custom data extraction forms\, and collaborating with lab membe
 rs. Learn how to transform hundreds or thousands of research papers into
  structured\, publication-ready evidence maps in a fraction of the time.
  Bring a research topic or paper collection to follow along. Curious if 
 Sysrev is for you? Watch this 2-minute video for a brief introduction: W
 elcome to SysRev (2min) Open to all Princeton faculty and staff. This ev
 ent will be recorded. About the speaker: TJ Bozada is Product Lead at In
 silica\, creators of Sysrev\, where he helps commercial\, \nAudience: Fa
 culty & Academic Professionals\, Staff\, Students\nhttps://www.princeton
 .edu/events/2026/getting-started-sysrev-platform-systematic-literature-r
 eviews-0
