 udents are invited to the workshop from 10:30 AM-12 noon\, followed by a
  networking lunch from 12 noon - 1 PM. Arts at Work illustrates possible
  career paths in the arts and creative fields\, and forges connections b
 etween current students and alumni. Sponsors Presented as part of the Ar
 ts At Work program by the Center for Career Development and Lewis Center
