 ff your week and make something with your hands. Our workshops are low-s
 takes with easy-to-learn crafts designed to give you a fun finished prod
 uct. During this workshop you will learn about the history of the paper 
 silhouette as well as several modern-day techniques for creating your ow
 n. You will leave the workshop having cut your own paper silhouette port
 rait. All supplies included. No experience necessary. Drop in for a bit 
